# operator-built avro corpora live in the package data dir so the declared path resolves
# from any CWD, but the containers themselves stay out of git: interventions.avro is 92MB of
# already-compressed avro (no delta or zlib win), it is rebuilt per AACT snapshot, and the
# fullmap bundle is handled the same out-of-band way. Rebuild steps: the "CTKP interventions"
# section of README.md.
src/relmedner/data/interventions/*.avro
src/relmedner/data/synthetic-ner-ade-tweets/*.avro
src/relmedner/data/synthetic-ner-ade-tweets/*.tsv
# bc5cdr containers follow the same out-of-band policy: built on wenceslaus from the
# NCBI CDR BioC XML corpus by /users/sgoetz/bc5cdr-staging/build_bc5cdr.py (rebuild
# commands and builder receipts in docs/bc5cdr.md), so git carries the docs, not the blobs.
src/relmedner/data/bc5cdr/*.avro
